WEBVTT

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:08.230
After school!

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.400
Wait!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.950
What's with this lineup of tutors?!

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.310
They're all demons who are super
 famous and, uh... very unique!

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:18.240
Truly, I'm quite impressed.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.950
I'm amazed we managed to get them all.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.480
I mean...

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.070
I know we're putting a lot 
of hope in the Misfit Class,

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.920
but I think we might be a <i>tad</i> bit harsh.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.690
You chose the tutors, 
didn't you, Kalego-sensei?

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.670
You're not actually trying to...

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.400
have the school reclaim the Royal One 
by giving them impossible tasks, are you?

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.570
Are you making this personal?

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.430
Well...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.440
I do quite enjoy seeing them suffer.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.840
Wow... That's dark.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.670
<i>That's part of what makes him so great!</i>

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.790
However...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.480
I simply chose the perfect tutors 
who will whip them into shape,

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.560
in a dignified manner.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.500
<b>Iruma's True Feelings</b>

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.730
"Iruma's True Feelings."

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.200
You poor things...

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.230
<i>We can't get out...</i>

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.110
<i>Damn her...</i>

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:58.120
How long are you going to keep me in here?!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.110
That all depends... on you, my dear.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.800
<i>You win!</i>

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.460
Damn it!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.460
Yay! I win again!

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.200
<i>How am I supposed to win against him?</i>

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.500
What's the matter? Are you done already?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.220
No... Not yet!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.230
Not yet!

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:29.000
Hey, if we continue to fight him separately,

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.860
we're never going to stand a chance.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:33.710
I was just thinking the same thing.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:34.810
Which means...

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:39.860
As much as I hate to do this, 
we're going to have to fight together.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.610
As much as I hate to do it, as well.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.800
Oho?

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.240
Come on, my baby-chans, sparkle even more.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.270
Right!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.180
More.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.170
Right!

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:51.590
Even more!

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:53.240
Right!

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.120
Here.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.250
Huh? What?

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.040
But this is...

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:08.390
This place is famous for making 
all kinds of insane things.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.640
The Magical Apparatus Battler!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.800
Your first assignment will be 
to get these crazy guys

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.600
to make you your bow, 
which'll be your partner!

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.040
So, uh...

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.150
I'm actually a member here.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.150
Wha—

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.450
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.390
What the hell? Why didn't 
you tell me sooner?!

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.260
I had no idea we were coming here!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:33.270
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:32.530
Now I'm embarrassed for bringing 
you here, acting like a know-it-all!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.320
Wouldn't have thought you'd be a 
member of this crazy bunch, though.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.120
Well, it's not too crazy now.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.150
It was basically acting as a storage 
space for magical apparatuses,

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:45.890
but we've all been working hard to clean it up.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.240
Come in.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.390
That's crazy!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.390
Oho, is that you, Mr. Iruma?!

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.550
Welcome! Welcome, I say!

00:04:57.550 --> 00:04:59.600
I'm the unrivaled genius inventor!

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.920
The reliable senpai in the Magical 
Apparatus Battler whom everyone loves!

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:06.410
Eligoth Schenell is alive and well!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.400
Oh, how rude, Mr. Iruma!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.110
And after I returned to this 
Battler during end-of-terminus

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:19.560
and am working hard to get 
it moving forward again!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.370
You didn't even come to say hi once!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.300
Harumph! Harumph!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:28.520
Seriously, I'm amazed you've managed 
to gather all this weird stuff.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:31.300
Well, I am a rather progressive inventor.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:35.000
Hey, look around already.

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:38.730
You're so shocked that this Battler 
went through a remonsterization?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:40.710
<b>Remonsterization</b>

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.580
Come on, don't be so glum.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:46.170
With all this stuff here, I'm sure 
we'll be able to find your bow's core.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.760
Hmm...

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.540
Hmm...

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.040
Guess this'll do.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.410
Quartz, Quartz!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.340
I'm able to make magical bows 
due to my bloodline ability,

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:13.240
but normal demons need a core 
to store their mana in.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.680
With wood, you get a wooden bow.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.930
With flowers, you get a flower bow.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.930
With iron, you get an iron bow.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.260
By using Evolve: Quartz, Quartz,

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:27.440
it's basically like we're making the bow 
grow into the shape we want it to.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.950
Oho! May I try that, as well?!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.080
Quartz, Quartz!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.830
H-He's...

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.490
My family heirloom!

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.290
I mean...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.370
That thing ain't gonna 
function as a bow, but...

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.370
No smell...

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:47.380
As you can see, Quartz, Quartz

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.290
shows us the user's personality.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.070
You need to be compatible 
with your core, too.

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:55.800
So choose wisely.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.680
That's easy to say, but...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.480
I highly recommend this one!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.860
Shut up. I'll shoot you.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.690
No! This is my precious waifu!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.690
These are...

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.240
Those are feathers from the 
guardian of Cutthroat Valley.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.320
Huh?!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.610
They're from the guardian?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.050
All right, give it a whirl!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.410
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.160
Ifrit mode!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.430
Quartz, Quartz!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.470
I did it!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.060
Did you see that? I made my bo—

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:33.550
Hi-yah.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.340
What?!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.120
Wh-What was that for?

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.910
Don't give me that.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.850
That's some impressive mana,

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.590
but you were just copying me with that one.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.800
It didn't fit you at all!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.120
You need to visualize the bow 
that you actually want.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.170
The bow that I actually want...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.120
<i>A bow that can protect everyone...</i>

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.070
Quartz, Quartz!

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.960
Nope, totally off! Next!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.420
Quartz, Quartz!

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:10.010
I-It looks so powerful!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.430
Not a chance. Next!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.540
Are you mocking me?

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.300
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.470
You get one more chance.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:22.180
Huh?

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.030
But there are still 
plenty of feathers left...

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.070
You don't get a second 
chance on the battlefield.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.650
The next school event, 
the Harvest Festival,

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.840
is an exam where you'll be 
fighting for your survival.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.910
It's basically a battlefield.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:43.020
An archer who can't use opportunities 
to their advantage in the battlefield

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.670
won't survive.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.350
If you're gonna become an archer,

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.800
you have to be able to make 
decisions when it counts!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:57.220
Anyway...

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.740
I'm gonna go shopping.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:00.680
You...

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.740
can concentrate on making 
that bow of yours!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:06.930
Wait, Master! Are you sure about this?

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.600
<i>If he's gonna give up, 
the sooner the better.</i>

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.030
Yeah! Good!

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.320
Give it your all! I know you can do it!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.300
Quartz, Quartz!

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.220
So close!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:28.880
Don't sweat it! You'll get it next time!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.160
R-Right...

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.810
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:35.870
I'll be right by your side 
until you get it down!

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.280
Thank you very much.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:02.160
You... did it.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.780
You did it! You did it!

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:05.600
I-I did it!

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.780
You did it! You did it! Way to go!

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.670
Listen to this, Robin!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:16.030
It took a little while, 
but he finally made a great bow!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.680
Wow, that's great, Nee-chan.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.170
That kid's got talent!

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:30.690
I'm going to quit after all. 
Thanks for everything.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.270
Why...

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.080
<i>The next one...</i>

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:48.830
<i>I'm sure the next one will...</i>

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.480
Don't worry, Nee-chan!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.850
I'm sure there'll eventually be an archer
 like you've never seen before!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:13.810
There won't be.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.900
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.480
<i>So what if he survived 
being my errand boy?</i>

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.500
<i>So what if he's a little 
different from the others?</i>

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.420
<i>I'm never...</i>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.000
<i>getting my hopes up again.</i>

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:34.290
<b>Hundred</b>

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:34.290
<b>Bullseyes</b>

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.720
You poor dears...

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.800
I should let them out...

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.460
But, oh!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:52.600
<i>I mustn't! This is their training!</i>

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.040
<i>Oh, but they seem to be suffering so...</i>

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.480
<i>I knew it. My training is far too extreme.</i>

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.110
<i>Sniffle...</i>

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.730
An additional 50 seconds.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.400
<i>My family told me, as well...</i>

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.110
<i>"There's no way you could be a tutor!"</i>

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:09.120
<i>Because I don't understand limits!</i>

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.900
<i>I'm just not cut out to do this.</i>

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.920
<i>I should cancel this.</i>

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.250
<i>I'll resign as their tutor—huh?</i>

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.640
Ugh, damn it...

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:34.390
<b>Wind Blade</b>

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.600
<i>Bloodline ability: Wind Blade.</i>

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.390
<i>He is able to freely control blades of wind.</i>

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:41.400
<b>Bed (My Area)</b>

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.240
<i>Bloodline ability: Bed (My Area).</i>

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:41.400
<i>He is able to manipulate the ground 
or any spot he sees as his bed.</i>

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.760
We were finally able to escape!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.250
I'm so tired, ugh!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.970
But I figured something out!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.710
Water and wind actually 
flow quite similarly!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:56.930
I was also finally able to recognize 
the water as the ground.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.250
But come on!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.930
You need to be clearer 
in your instructions! Jeez!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.670
Master! Do we pass now?

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:05.910
Wah!

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.320
You were able to think on your own 
and come up with solutions!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.980
Well done!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.360
You are truly worthy of being my students!

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.840
Thank you!

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.840
Hey! That's cold!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.180
You're too close! 
You've got snot coming out!

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.990
Wait! We're gonna drown again!

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:22.560
In order to establish proper relations 
with a magical beast, the key is contact.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.440
You must hold them in high 
regard and respect them.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.780
That is love!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.140
If you find creatures filthy 
and smelly and despise them,

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.790
that is a critical flaw for a summoner.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.830
Hence your training...

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.540
But this sight is truly... inconceivable!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.260
Listen well.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:47.480
Don't you dare cross that line.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.740
Her spirit and elegance 
won't allow them to argue...

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:54.890
She is truly... a lady.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:55.920
Nay!

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.000
She has the potential to become a queen!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.590
And...

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:04.170
I see that you are also a 
true gentleman, G. Camui.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.410
You are quite right, Master.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:10.550
Though they are different 
species, they are ladies.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:13.260
Indeed, Divi.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.120
Hello?!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.440
Could you let me out already?!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.680
<i>You win!</i>

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:22.150
Ugh, not again! Damn it!

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.590
I guess I win again.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.530
You okay?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.560
Want to take a break and 
check up on Iruma-kun?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.180
No!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.360
We're doing best out of five!
 I haven't lost yet!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.320
<i>He's been playing non-stop,</i>

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.190
<i>so his concentration probably 
won't last much longer.</i>

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.520
<i>Oh, fine.</i>

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.210
<i>I guess I don't mind holding back a tiny bit.</i>

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:46.020
<i>I read in some book that positive 
reinforcement does wonders.</i>

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.500
Huh?

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.040
<i>You lose!</i>

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.120
Huh? I lost?!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.600
<i>But I hadn't started holding back!</i>

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.970
Come on, Sensei. 
You can't hold back like that.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.450
Huh?

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.080
<i>This was on purpose?!</i>

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.910
<i>He lost on purpose at first
so I'd let my guard down?</i>

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:12.630
<i>We just need to play these games, 
but he's seriously trying to win?</i>

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.430
<i>His concentration's gone up!</i>

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.190
Here we go, you fool!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.190
I know, you moron!

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:28.010
That was a hit! We got a hit in, didn't we?!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:28.820
Um, yes.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.320
Then we pass?!

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.320
Yes.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.830
Yes!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.700
<i>How surprising...</i>

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.600
<i>At first, they were just 
attacking recklessly,</i>

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.160
Not bad.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.770
You, as well.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.880
<i>but their movements improved as soon 
as they started working together.</i>

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.710
<i>I said they only needed to get one hit in,</i>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.820
<i>but to think I'd receive 
a calculated attack...</i>

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.200
<i>Truly...</i>

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.560
<i>What wonderful students.</i>

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.600
Magnificent!

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:59.190
You truly are a natural at this!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.250
Oh, I'm so happy!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.290
Come, now. Don't let your guard down!

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.970
I guess the only problem left is...

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.570
Ta-da!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.160
Baby-chan, listen...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:14.820
Oh?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.820
Huh? She's gone?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.730
I'm right here!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.580
Did I surprise you?

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:27.510
<i>Wait, did my heart just skip a beat? Mine?!</i>

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.660
I call it Rolly, Rolly, Into Your Pocket.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.140
Wow!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:33.960
Rolly, rolly, rolly...

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.570
<i>Her purity itself makes 
her sexiness shine through?!</i>

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.640
<i>The element of surprise!</i>

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.480
Ooh, it's all frilly!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:38.520
Come, now...

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:39.730
It's so silky smooth!

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.540
<i>How interesting!</i>

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:46.280
What the heck are you shopping for?

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:49.180
Well, I haven't been to the city in ages!

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:52.740
You must wrap my waifu much more carefully!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.730
Jeez...

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.640
I don't care that he tagged along, 
but man, he's annoying.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:00.160
<i>I wonder what happened with that kid's bow.</i>

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.520
It's finished.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:04.910
<b>It's finished~</b>

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.910
<b>Puny</b>

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:05.250
<i>He doesn't seem to have any desires...</i>

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:08.340
<i>Even if he's able to make one, 
it'll probably be harmless.</i>

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:12.280
<i>He honestly might've just 
given up and gone home.</i>

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.600
<i>A bow that can protect isn't right, either...</i>

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.480
<i>And a powerful bow is wrong, too?</i>

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.300
<i>What's the answer?</i>

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.720
A winning bow? A macho bow?

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.450
A charming bow? No!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.520
A cute one? No!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:34.940
It's no use...

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:36.880
This is too hard. I have no idea.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.580
What kind of bow do I really want?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.750
Bow... that I want...

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.470
Desire...

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.510
A delicious... bow?

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.870
Hey, you glutton.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.140
Ali-san!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.790
Don't gasp at me like that.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.440
You're thinking way too hard about this.

00:17:57.440 --> 00:18:00.050
Soften that stone head of yours.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.250
Ugh, you're so stubborn!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:03.560
Soften...

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:06.560
You do have the choice of 
changing tutors, you know.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.550
No one said you <i>have</i> to use a bow.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.320
No! That's just infuriating!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.580
This is the first time I've wanted
 to prove someone wrong!

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.880
...the biggest moron I've ever met.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.470
Even if I end up her errand boy 
or get yelled at a lot,

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.940
I don't want to give up.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:30.990
I don't care what she says...

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.920
But just a simple phrase...

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.000
I want Master to compliment me!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.630
Jeez, you're hopeless.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.950
In that case,

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:45.520
I guess it's time to show that 
shrimpy master who's boss.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.870
Tell me, Li'l Iru!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.830
What's your most embarrassing desire that 
you never want anyone to learn about?

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:50.520
Huh?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.650
Embarrassing? Why?!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.100
Listen up, Li'l Iru.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:58.600
Desires aren't about pretty things 
like being strong or protecting others.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.760
It's all about the true 
feelings that you're hiding!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:01.660
I know you have them!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.510
Huh?

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.480
Come on, show me!

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.050
Huh?!

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:04.910
Go on!

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:09.240
But I'm human... and not like the rest of you...

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:10.210
But...

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.010
I want to stay with everyone, so... um...

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:14.050
Huh?!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.800
What was that?! Speak up, son!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:21.080
I want to stay together with everyone

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.440
and boldly advance to Dalet!

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.760
That's the kind of hero I want to be!

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.080
Man, that's embarrassing!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.520
Okay, now say the words!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.640
Quartz, Quartz!

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:36.410
We've finally returned to Babyls.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.190
Seriously, though. Your bag reeks.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.660
Those meds or whatever you've got.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.200
Hurry up and toss that stuff somewhere.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.770
Okay!

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.600
<i>Sheesh. What kind of meds did he even get?</i>

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:51.600
What the...

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.280
What's the matter, Creepy Glasses?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.040
Iru... Iru... Mr. Iruma...

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.370
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.050
<i>I'm sure there'll eventually...</i>

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:09.490
<i>be an archer like you've never seen before!</i>

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:12.680
<i>I'm never...</i>

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.680
<i>getting my hopes up again.</i>

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.200
<i>I'll never...</i>

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.960
<i>The truth is, if any of the 
tutors had determined that</i>

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:25.680
<i>any of the members of the Misfit Class 
had no potential to advance to Dalet,</i>

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:29.260
<i>they would have left immediately.</i>

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:33.790
<i>But the students possessed natural talent 
and the element of surprise,</i>

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.080
<i>and they worked their hardesr, so they 
all far surpassed their expectations.</i>

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.250
<i>The members of the Misfit 
Class were acknowledged.</i>

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.800
<i>Yes... They had truly been acknowledged.</i>

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.560
Oh, you're just so...

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.400
All of you children are so worth...

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:52.220
...working to the bone.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.460
I guess we can be a bit stricter.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.520
Let's keep pushing further and further...

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.820
Further and further.

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:03.440
<b>Aaaaah　</b>

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:03.440
<b>Eeeeek</b>

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:03.440
<b>Gyaah</b>

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:03.440
<i>For the next several weeks, 
the members of the Misfit Class...</i>

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:06.740
<i>saw what Hell was like.</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.400
Hello!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.830
Can you believe it? The Harvest 
Festival is finally tomorrow!

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.110
How are the lovely members 
of the Misfit Class doing?

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.710
How are they, indeed?

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.660
Jeez, you're so cold.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.010
<i>Aha, that expression...</i>

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:25.240
<i>He's definitely excited about this.</i>

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:33.020
<b>Misfit Class Training Report Training Complete</b>

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:33.020
<b>Iruma | Shax Lead

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:29.360
<i>Now, we will see the survival 
of the fittest play out</i>

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:32.070
<i>at the Harvest Festival.</i>

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:07.370
Su-Ki-Ma, indeed!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:07.240
<b>Su</b>

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:07.240
<b>Ki</b>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.240
<b>Ma</b>

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:11.400
<i>Ameri has come to see 
how Iruma's training is going.</i>

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:13.230
<i>I'm going to give him some encouragement.</i>

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:15.730
<i>It's not like I just want to see his face...</i>

00:23:15.730 --> 00:23:18.800
<i>But as his senpai and winner of each year...</i>

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:21.720
<i>I'm just going to give him advice 
for the Harvest Festival!</i>

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:24.620
<i>Yes! That is all! Right!</i>

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:26.420
Pardon me!

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:30.540
Wh-What in the world is this?!

00:23:31.310 --> 00:23:33.960
D-Don't tell me Iruma made this!

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:35.970
Tap, tap, tap... whew.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:37.080
It's my masterpiece!

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:39.810
W-Well, if that's the case...

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:42.810
B-But, oh, this is so bold!

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:46.420
<i>My family heirloom... The Eternal Venus.</i>

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:48.760
<i>Sculpted by Eligoth Schenell.</i>

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:53.560
<i>Removed.</i>

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:55.980
<i>I have determined this was inappropriate 
to have on school grounds.</i>

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:58.270
<i>The sculptor should go see 
the student council immediately.</i>

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:00.000
My family heirloom!

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.240
Wh-Why has this tragedy befallen me?!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:05.880
The Harvest Festival finally begins.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:09.400
I wanted to give Iruma advice, 
but to think I couldn't even see him...

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.850
No, no. This also happened 
in <i>First Love Memories</i>.

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:16.120
Kakeru was trapped in a time prison 
and couldn't see Rin for so long!

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.790
His absence made their hearts grow fonder!

00:24:18.790 --> 00:24:20.520
Next time on <i>Welcome to 
Demon School! Iruma-kun</i>,

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:22.210
"The Signal That the 
Harvest Festival Has Begun."

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:22.690
That's right.

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:25.720
The Harvest Festival signals the path 
toward me and Iruma's m-m-marriage!

00:24:25.720 --> 00:24:27.980
What in the world am I saying?!
